## Third-Party Libraries

This project uses the following third-party libraries:

### Lombok
- **License**: MIT License
- **Website**: https://projectlombok.org/
- **Purpose**: Annotation-based code generation for reducing boilerplate code

### MySQL Connector/J
- **License**: GPL v2 with FOSS License Exception
- **Website**: https://dev.mysql.com/downloads/connector/j/
- **Purpose**: JDBC driver for MySQL database connectivity

### Java Standard Library
- **License**: Oracle No-Fee Terms and Conditions (NFTC)
- **Website**: https://www.oracle.com/java/
